title: Caversket Elections
new-page: true
tags: event
priority: -1
view-if: (year = next_election_year and month >= next_election_month) or (year > next_election_year)
on-departure: month_actions += 1; in_election = 0; next_election_year = next_election_year + 4; n_elections += 1; next_election_time = time + 48; papen_chancellor_timer = 4;
set-jump: post_election_1928
face-image: img/Rothe_Wahlen_1903.jpg

# TODO: should there be an image?

# the low priority means that this event is only seen after all other events are resolved for the month.

= Elections, [+ month : month +] [+ year +]

The Caversket elections are to be held now.

- @election_algorithm: May we do our best...
- @cancel_elections

@cancel_elections
title: We cannot hold the elections now. Cancel the elections.
subtitle: This is an anti-democratic move that may backfire.
view-if: in_emergency_government == 1 and president == "Braun" and not presidential_powers

Since we are currently ruling as part of an emergency government, we may use quasi-constitutional trickery to significantly delay these elections, and continue governing via Article 48. This is likely to be extremely unpopular both with our base and with the other parties. However, this may be necessary to prevent the extremists from gaining power.

- @cancel_elections_2: Yes, do it.
- @election_algorithm: No, let's hold the elections.

@cancel_elections_2
on-departure: next_election_year = next_election_year + 1; next_election_time = time + 12; pro_republic -= 10; dvp_relation -= 8; z_relation -= 8; ddp_relation -= 10; kpd_relation -= 8; coup_progress += 2; workers_spd -= 4; new_middle_spd -= 5; old_middle_spd -= 5; rural_spd -= 5; catholics_spd -= 5; unemployed_spd -= 5; coup_progress += 2 if nsdap_normalized >= 0.3; coup_progress += 2 if nsdap_normalized + dnvp_normalized >= 0.5; sa_strength += 100 if coup_progress >= 7; sh_strength += 100 if coup_progress >= 7
achievement: ausnahmezustand

Fine. President [+ president +] has taken the unprecedented step of canceling these elections. New elections are scheduled for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +].

Let us hope this does not backfire.

@post_election_1928
on-arrival: {!
// set old results
// election threshold constitutional reform
// banning parties
var new_party_sum = 0;
for (var party of Q.parties) {
    Q['old_' + party + '_r'] = Q[party + '_r'];
    if (Q.constitutional_reform > 0) {
        if (Q[party + '_votes'] < Q.electoral_threshold || (Q.electoral_threshold > 1 && party == 'other') || Q[party + '_banned']) {
            Q[party + '_r'] = 0;
        } else {
            Q[party + '_r'] = Q[party + '_votes'];
        }
        new_party_sum += Q[party + '_r'];
    } else {
        Q[party + '_r'] = Q[party + '_votes'];
    }
    // if we use decimals, then we might want to truncate the numbers
    if (Q.use_decimals) {
        Q[party + '_r_disp'] = Q[party+'_r'].toFixed(1);
    }  else {
            Q[party + '_r_disp'] = Q[party+'_r'];
    }
    Q['change_' + party + '_r'] = Q[party + '_r'] - Q['old_' + party + '_r'];
    var sign = Q['change_' + party + '_r'] > 0 ? '+'  : '';
    Q['str_change_' + party] = sign + Q['change_' + party + '_r'];//.toFixed(1);
}
for (var party of Q.parties) {
        Q['change_' + party + '_r'] = Q[party + '_r'] - Q['old_' + party + '_r'];
        var sign = Q['change_' + party + '_r'] > 0 
                   ? '<img src="img/arrowup.png"> ' 
                   : Q['change_' + party + '_r'] < 0 
                     ? '<img src="img/arrowdown.png"> ' 
                     : '<img src="img/steady.png"> ';
        Q['change_' + party + '_r'] = Math.abs(Q['change_' + party + '_r']);
        Q['str_change_' + party] = sign + parseFloat(Q['change_' + party + '_r']).toFixed(1);
    
        // Calculate changes in votes
        Q['change_' + party + '_votes'] = Q[party + '_votes'] - Q['previous_' + party + '_last_election_votes'];
        if (Q['previous_' + party + '_last_election_votes'] === undefined) {
            Q['change_' + party + '_votes'] = Q[party + '_votes'];
        }
        var sign2 = Q['change_' + party + '_votes'] > 0 
                    ? '<img src="img/arrowup.png"> ' 
                    : Q['change_' + party + '_votes'] < 0 
                      ? '<img src="img/arrowdown.png"> ' 
                      : '<img src="img/steady.png"> ';
        Q['str_votes_change_' + party] = sign2 + Math.abs(Q['change_' + party + '_votes']).toFixed(1);
    }
// calculate new party sum if electoral reform
if (Q.electoral_threshold && Q.electoral_threshold > 0) {
    for (var party of Q.parties) {
        if (Q[party + '_r'] > 0) {
            if (Q.use_decimals) {
                Q[party + '_r'] = Math.round((Q[party + '_r']*1000/new_party_sum)/10).toFixed(1);
            } else {
                Q[party + '_r'] = Math.round(Q[party + '_r']*100/new_party_sum);
            }
        }
        if (Q.use_decimals) {
            Q[party + '_r_disp'] = Q[party+'_r'].toFixed(1);
        } else {
            Q[party + '_r_disp'] = Q[party+'_r'];
        }
        Q['change_' + party + '_r'] = Q[party + '_r'] - Q['old_' + party + '_r'];
        var sign = Q['change_' + party + '_r'] > 0 ? '+'  : '';
        Q['str_change_' + party] = sign + Q['change_' + party + '_r'];//.toFixed(1);
    }
}

// get change arrows and signs


// The largest party can only be the NSDAP or the SPD.
Q.largest_party = 'SPD';
if (Q.nsdap_r >= Q.spd_r && Q.nsdap_r >= Q.kpd_r) {
    Q.largest_party = 'NSDAP';
}

if (Q.kpd_r >= Q.spd_r && Q.kpd_r >= Q.nsdap_r) {
    Q.largest_party = 'KPD';
}

Q.leverage = Q.spd_r;

Q.grand_coalition_failed = 0;
// Reset government and ministers... Based on Brüning's 1930 govt
Q.coalition_dissent = 0;
Q.kpd_coalition_dissent = 0;
Q.spd_in_government = 0;
Q.in_weimar_coalition = 0;
Q.in_grand_coalition = 0;
Q.in_left_front = 0;
Q.in_popular_front = 0;
Q.in_emergency_government = 0;
Q.in_minority_government = 0;
Q.in_unity_government = 0;
Q.spd_toleration = 0;
Q.spd_caretaker = 0;

Q.coalition_fail = 0;

Q.spd_in_government = 0;
Q.ppu_in_government = 0;
Q.z_in_government = 0;
Q.ddp_in_government = 0;
Q.dvp_in_government = 0;
Q.dnvp_in_government = 0;
Q.sapd_in_government = 0;
Q.spm_in_government = 0;
Q.asum_in_government = 0;
Q.nsdap_in_government = 0;
Q.blpm_in_government = 0;
Q.gnvp_in_government = 0;
Q.vsp_in_government = 0;

// reset KPD goals
Q.kpd_goals_seen = 0;
Q.kpd_ultimatum_seen = 0;
Q.welfare_goal = 0;
Q.agriculture_goal = 0;
Q.economy_goal = 0;
Q.finance_goal = 0;
Q.labor_goal = 0;
Q.foreign_goal = 0;
Q.interior_goal = 0;
Q.reichswehr_goal = 0;

Q.lib_dissident = 0;
Q.right_dissidnet = 0;
Q.coalition_dissent = 0;

Q.welfare_goal_completed = 0;
Q.agriculture_goal_completed = 0;
Q.economy_goal_completed = 0;
Q.finance_goal_completed = 0;
Q.labor_goal_completed = 0;
Q.foreign_goal_completed = 0;
Q.interior_goal_completed = 0;
Q.reichswehr_goal_completed = 0;

Q.strike_term_seen = 0;

Q.others_main = Q.vsp_strength + 3 + 5 + 6 + 3;

Q.vsp_r = Q.other_r/Q.others_main*Q.vsp_strength;
Q.zel_r = Q.other_r/Q.others_main*3;
Q.ltp_r = Q.other_r/Q.others_main*6;
Q.mtu_r = Q.other_r/Q.others_main*5;
Q.other_other_r = Q.other_r/Q.others_main*3;


Q.vsp_r = (Q.vsp_r != undefined ? parseFloat(Q.vsp_r.toFixed(1)) : 0);
Q.zel_r = (Q.zel_r != undefined ? parseFloat(Q.zel_r.toFixed(1)) : 0);
Q.ltp_r = (Q.ltp_r != undefined ? parseFloat(Q.ltp_r.toFixed(1)) : 0);
Q.mtu_r = (Q.mtu_r != undefined ? parseFloat(Q.mtu_r.toFixed(1)) : 0);
Q.other_other_r = (Q.other_other_r != undefined ? parseFloat(Q.other_other_r.toFixed(1)) : 0);

Q.other_r = (Q.other_r != undefined ? parseFloat(Q.other_r.toFixed(1)) : 0);

// coalitions - VDSPM
Q.left_coalition = (Q.spd_r + Q.sapd_r + Q.spm_r + Q.asum_r + Q.vsp_r).toFixed(1);
Q.progressive_coalition = (Q.spd_r + Q.sapd_r + Q.spm_r + Q.asum_r + Q.ddp_r + Q.zel_r).toFixed(1);
Q.progressive_coalition_2 = (Q.spd_r + Q.spm_r + Q.ddp_r + Q.zel_r ).toFixed(1);
Q.popular_front_coalition = (Q.spd_r + Q.sapd_r + Q.spm_r + Q.asum_r + Q.z_r + Q.ddp_r + Q.vsp_r + Q.zel_r).toFixed(1);
Q.weimar_coalition = (Q.spd_r + Q.ddp_r + Q.z_r + Q.spm_r + Q.vsp_r + Q.zel_r).toFixed(1);
Q.zeltbrin_plus_coalition = (Q.spd_r + Q.ddp_r + Q.z_r + Q.blpm_r + Q.ppu_r + Q.spm_r + Q.vsp_r + Q.zel_r).toFixed(1);
Q.grand_coalition = (Q.spd_r + Q.spm_r + Q.ddp_r + Q.z_r + Q.ppu_r + Q.dvp_r + Q.blpm_r + Q.vsp_r + Q.zel_r).toFixed(1);

Q.liberal_coalition = (Q.z_r + Q.ddp_r + Q.dvp_r + Q.ppu_r + Q.blpm_r + Q.zel_r).toFixed(1); 
Q.wide_liberal_coalition = (Q.z_r + Q.ddp_r + Q.dvp_r + Q.ppu_r + Q.blpm_r + Q.zel_r + Q.ltp_r + Q.other_other_r).toFixed(1);
Q.center_right_coalition = (Q.z_r + Q.dvp_r + Q.dnvp_r + Q.gnvp_r + Q.ltp_r + Q.other_other_r + Q.mtu_r + Q.zel_r).toFixed(1);
if (Q.ppu_path == -1) {
Q.center_right_coalition += Q.ppu_r;
}
Q.center_right_coalition = (Q.center_right_coalition).toFixed(1);
Q.right_coalition = (Q.dvp_r + Q.dnvp_r + Q.gnvp_r + Q.ltp_r + Q.other_other_r + Q.mtu_r).toFixed(1);
Q.far_right_coalition = (Q.dnvp_r + Q.nsdap_r + Q.gnvp_r + Q.ltp_r + Q.other_other_r + Q.mtu_r).toFixed(1);
Q.far_right_ldp = (Q.dnvp_r + Q.nsdap_r + Q.gnvp_r + Q.ltp_r + Q.other_other_r + Q.mtu_r + Q.dvp_r).toFixed(1);
// this is an absurd concept lol
Q.anti_democratic_coalition_r = (Q.nsdap_r + Q.dnvp_r + Q.sapd_r);
if (Q.liberal_reconciliation <= 12) {
Q.anti_democratic_coalition_r = Q.anti_democratic_coalition_r + Q.spd_r/2;
}
Q.anti_democratic_coalition_r = (Q.anti_democratic_coalition_r).toFixed(1);
// aka everyone except nazi, kpd, dnvp
// Hitler + Right-wing parties (only comes into effect if you've alienated Z too badly)
Q.hitler_right_coalition = (Q.dnvp_r + Q.nsdap_r + Q.ltp_r + Q.other_other_r + Q.mtu_r + Q.gnvp_r).toFixed(1);

Q.kpm_coa = (Q.kpm_modifier*Q.sapd_relation);
Q.spm_coa = (Q.spm_modifier*Q.spm_relation);
Q.fvp_coa = (Q.fvp_modifier*Q.ddp_relation);
Q.gdsu_coa = (Q.gdsu_modifier*Q.z_relation);
Q.ppu_coa = (Q.ppu_relation);
Q.blpm_coa = (Q.fvp_modifier*Q.ldp_modifier*Q.dvp_relation);
Q.ldp_coa = (Q.ldp_modifier*Q.dvp_relation);
Q.other_coa = (Q.fvp_modifier*Q.ldp_modifier*Q.gdsu_modifier*50);

if (Q.spm_ally) {
    Q.spm_coa += 20;
    }
if (Q.kpm_ally) {
    Q.kpm_coa += 20;
    }
if (Q.ppu_ally) {
    Q.ppu_coa += 20;
    }
if (Q.fvp_ally) {
    Q.fvp_coa += 20;
    }

if (Q.sapd_formed == 0) {
    Q.fvp_coa -= 10;
    }
if (Q.sapd_formed == 0) {
    Q.gdsu_coa -= 20;
    }
if (Q.sapd_formed == 0) {
    Q.blpm_coa -= 20;
    }
if (Q.sapd_formed == 0) {
    Q.ldp_coa -= 30;
    }

if (Q.party_policy_fed == 2) {
    Q.ppu_coa += 10;
    }
if (Q.party_policy_fed == 2) {
    Q.other_coa += 10;
    }
if (Q.party_policy_fed == 0) {
    Q.ppu_coa -= 10;
    }

Q.kpm_coa += Q.party_policy_main*2;
Q.spm_coa -= Q.party_policy_main;

Q.spd_r_coa = 0;
Q.asum_r_coa = 0;
Q.spm_r_coa = 0;
Q.sapd_r_coa = 0;
Q.ddp_r_coa = 0;
Q.ppu_r_coa = 0;
Q.vsp_r_coa = 0;
Q.z_r_coa = 0;
Q.dvp_r_coa = 0;
Q.dnvp_r_coa = 0;
Q.nsdap_r_coa = 0;
Q.other_r_coa = 0;
Q.gnvp_r_coa = 0;
Q.blpm_r_coa = 0;

Q.coa_tention = 0;

Q.failed = 0;

Q.custom_coalition_r = Q.spd_r;

// understanding the enemy
if (Q.nsdap_r >= 15) {
    Q.understanding_enemy_timer = 2;
}

var election_result = {'date': new Date(Q.year, Q.month - 1)};
for (var party of Q.parties) {
    election_result[party] = Q[party + '_r'];
}
Q.election_records.push(election_result);
!}
on-departure: nazi_urgency = 1 if (nazi_urgency == 0 and nsdap_r >= 15)
on-display: {!
data = [];
if (Q.sapd_formed && Q.sapd_r) {
    data.push({
            "id": "sapd",
            "legend": "KPM",
            "name": "KPM",
            "seats": Math.round(Q.sapd_r*5),
            });
}
if (Q.asum_formed && Q.asum_r) {
    data.push({
            "id": "asum",
            "legend": "ASUM",
            "name": "ASUM",
            "seats": Math.round(Q.asum_r*5),
            });
}
data = data.concat([
    {
        "id": "spd",
        "legend": Q.spd_name,
        "name": Q.spd_name,
        "seats": Math.round(Q.spd_r*5),
    },
    ]);
if (Q.spm_formed && Q.spm_r) {
    data.push({
            "id": "spm",
            "legend": "SPM",
            "name": "SPM",
            "seats": Math.round(Q.spm_r*5),
            });
}
data = data.concat([
    {
        "id": "vsp",
        "legend": "VSP",
        "name": "VSP",
        "seats": Math.round(Q.vsp_r*5),
    },
    {
        "id": "ddp",
        "legend": Q.ddp_name,
        "name": Q.ddp_name,
        "seats": Math.round(Q.ddp_r*5),
    },
    {
        "id": "znc",
        "legend": "TEL",
        "name": "TEL",
        "seats": Math.round(Q.zel_r*5),
    },
    {
        "id": "z",
        "legend": "GDSU",
        "name": "GDSU",
        "seats": Math.round(Q.z_r*5),
    },
    ]);
if (Q.blpm_formed && Q.blpm_r) {
    data.push({
            "id": "blpm",
            "legend": "BLPM",
            "name": "BLPM",
            "seats": Math.round(Q.blpm_r*5),
            });
}
data = data.concat([
    {
        "id": "bra",
        "legend": "BRA",
        "name": "BAR",
        "seats": Math.round(Q.ppu_r*1),
    },
    {
        "id": "bvp",
        "legend": "PPU",
        "name": "PPU",
        "seats": Math.round(Q.ppu_r*3),
    },
    {
        "id": "lac",
        "legend": "LRNL",
        "name": "LRNL",
        "seats": Math.round(Q.ppu_r*1),
    },
    {
        "id": "dvp",
        "legend": Q.dvp_name,
        "name": Q.dvp_name,
        "seats": Math.round(Q.dvp_r*5),
    },
    {
        "id": "other",
        "legend": "Other",
        "name": "Other",
        "seats": Math.round(Q.other_other_r*5),
    },
    {
        "id": "ltp",
        "legend": "ltp",
        "name": "ltp",
        "seats": Math.round(Q.ltp_r*5),
    },
    {
        "id": "sud",
        "legend": "MTP",
        "name": "MTP",
        "seats": Math.round(Q.mtu_r*5),
    },
]);
if (Q.gnvp_formed && Q.gnvp_r) {
    data.push({
            "id": "gnvp",
            "legend": "GNVP",
            "name": "GNVP",
            "seats": Math.round(Q.gnvp_r*5),
            });
}
data = data.concat([
    {
        "id": "dnvp",
        "legend": "MNVP",
        "name": "MNVP",
        "seats": Math.round(Q.dnvp_r*5),
    },
    {
        "id": "nsdap",
        "legend": "NSDAP",
        "name": "NSDAP",
        "seats": Math.round(Q.nsdap_r*5),
    },
]);

if (window && d3) {
    var width = 500; 
    var height = 500;
    var screenWidth = document.getElementById('content').offsetWidth;
    if (screenWidth < width - 50) {
        width = screenWidth - 50; 
        height = width;
        document.getElementById("reichstag").style.height = screenWidth/2 + "px";
    } 

    var parliament = d3.parliament();
    parliament.width(width).height(height).innerRadiusCoef(0.4);
    parliament.enter.fromCenter(true).smallToBig(true);
    parliament.exit.toCenter(false).bigToSmall(true);
    d3.select("#reichstag").datum(data).call(parliament);
}
!}
go-to: coalition_menu

= Election results

{!<svg id="reichstag" style="width: 500px; height: 250px;"> </svg>!}

{!<table>!} 
{!<tr><td>Party</td><td>Vote share</td><td>% Change</td></tr>!}
{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#dc0100; outline: 2px; outline-style: solid;'> </div> !} **[+ spd_name +]:** {!</td><td>!} **[+ spd_r +]%** {!</td><td>!} **[+ str_change_spd +]** {!</td></tr>!}

[? if sapd_formed : {!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#920002'> </div> !}KPM: {!</td><td>!} [+ sapd_r +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ str_change_sapd +] {!</td></tr>!} ?]

[? if asum_formed : {!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#dd5b00'> </div> !}ASUM: {!</td><td>!} [+ asum_r +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ str_change_asum +] {!</td></tr>!} ?]

[? if spm_formed : {!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#dd5b00'> </div> !}SPM: {!</td><td>!} [+ spm_r +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ str_change_spm +] {!</td></tr>!} ?]

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#ddd500'> </div> !} [+ ddp_name +]: {!</td><td>!} [+ ddp_r +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ str_change_ddp +] {!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#48b94a'> </div> !} GDSU: {!</td><td>!} [+ z_r +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ str_change_z +] {!</td></tr>!}

[? if blpm_formed : {!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#00e8ff'> </div> !}BLPM: {!</td><td>!} [+ blpm_r +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ str_change_blpm +] {!</td></tr>!} ?]

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#4b9ee0'> </div> !} PPU+: {!</td><td>!} [+ ppu_r +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ str_change_ppu +] {!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#caa58b'> </div> !} [+ dvp_name +]: {!</td><td>!} [+ dvp_r +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ str_change_dvp +] {!</td></tr>!}
 
[? if gnvp_formed : {!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#774ae2'> </div> !}GNVP: {!</td><td>!} [+ gnvp_r +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ str_change_gnvp +] {!</td></tr>!} ?]

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#1125e0'> </div> !} MNVP: {!</td><td>!} [+ dnvp_r +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ str_change_dnvp +] {!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#706a65'> </div> !} NSDAP: {!</td><td>!} [+ nsdap_r +]% {!</td><td>!} [+ str_change_nsdap +] {!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:#dddddd'> </div> !} Others: {!</td><td>!} [+ other_r +] % {!</td><td>!} [+ str_change_other +] {!</td></tr>!}

{!</table>!}

<span class="tooltip-text" title="Volks-Socilistiche Partei" style="color: #ff7b00;">VSP</span> [+ vsp_r +] %, <span class="tooltip-text" title="Tippleford Einhesitliste" style="color: #87c4df;">TEL</span> [+ zel_r +] %, <span class="tooltip-text" title="Landliche-Tremann Partei" style="color: #1b7035;">LTP</span> [+ ltp_r +] %, <span class="tooltip-text" title="Merkopishe-Traditionell Union" style="color: #8c1a16;">MTU</span> [+ mtu_r +] %, Minor [+ other_other_r +] %

**Potential coalitions:**

<span style="color: #dc0200;">Zel</span><span style="color: #ddd500;">tb</span><span style="color: #48b94a;">rin</span> Coalition (<span style="color: #dc0200;">**[+ spd_name +]**</span> + <span style="color: #ff7b00;">VSP</span> + <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span> + <span style="color: #87c4df;">TEL</span> + <span style="color: #48b94a;">GDSU</span>): [+ weimar_coalition +]%

[? if weimar_coalition < 50 and liberal_reconciliation >= 10: Wide - <span style="color: #dc0200;">Zel</span><span style="color: #ddd500;">tb</span><span style="color: #48b94a;">rin</span> Coalition (<span style="color: #dc0200;">**[+ spd_name +]**</span> + <span style="color: #ff7b00;">VSP</span> + <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span> + <span style="color: #87c4df;">TEL</span> + <span style="color: #48b94a;">GDSU</span> + <span style="color: #4a9fde;">PPU</span>[? if blpm_formed = 1 : + <span style="color: #00e8ff;">BLPM</span> ?]): [+ zeltbrin_plus_coalition +]% ?]

[? if liberal_reconciliation >= 12: Grand Coalition (<span style="color: #dc0200;">**[+ spd_name +]**</span> + <span style="color: #ff7b00;">VSP</span> + <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span> + <span style="color: #87c4df;">TEL</span> + <span style="color: #48b94a;">GDSU</span> + <span style="color: #4a9fde;">PPU</span> + <span style="color: #caa58b;">[+ dvp_name +]</span> [? if blpm_formed = 1 : + <span style="color: #00e8ff;">BLPM</span> ?]): [+ grand_coalition +]% ?]

Liberal Coalition (<span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span> + <span style="color: #87c4df;">TEL</span> + <span style="color: #48b94a;">GDSU</span> + <span style="color: #4a9fde;">PPU</span> + [? if blpm_formed = 1 : + <span style="color: #00e8ff;">BLPM</span> ?] <span style="color: #caa58b;">[+ dvp_name +]</span>): [+ liberal_coalition +]%

[? if liberal_coalition < 50 : Wide - Liberal Coalition (<span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span> + <span style="color: #87c4df;">TEL</span> + <span style="color: #48b94a;">GDSU</span> + <span style="color: #4a9fde;">PPU</span> + <span style="color: #caa58b;">[+ dvp_name +]</span> + [? if blpm_formed = 1 : + <span style="color: #00e8ff;">BLPM</span> ?]<span style="color: #1b7035;">LTP</span> + others): [+ wide_liberal_coalition +]% ?]

Center-Right Coalition (<span style="color: #48b94a;">GDSU</span> + <span style="color: #caa58b;">[+ dvp_name +]</span> + <span style="color: #1b7035;">LTP</span> + <span style="color: #8c1a16;">MTU</span> + others + <span style="color: #3F7BC1;">MNVP</span> [? if ppu_path = -1 : + <span style="color: #4a9fde;">PPU</span>  ?][? if gnvp_formed = 1 : + <span style="color: #774ae2;">GNVP</span>  ?][? if blpm_formed = 1 : + <span style="color: #00e8ff;">BLPM</span>  ?]): [+ center_right_coalition +]%

Right-wing Coalition (<span style="color: #caa58b;">[+ dvp_name +]</span> + <span style="color: #1b7035;">LTP</span> + <span style="color: #8c1a16;">MTU</span> + others + <span style="color: #3F7BC1;">MNVP</span> [? if gnvp_formed = 1 : + <span style="color: #774ae2;">GNVP</span> ?]): [+ right_coalition +]%

[? if nazi_urgency <= 1 and nsdap_r >= 15 : The rapid rise in <span style="color: #706a65;">NSDAP</span> votes is extremely worrying. Many had believed that the party was moribund; now, some of us consider it to be the greatest threat to democracy in Merkopia. ?]

[? if anti_democratic_coalition >= 50 : Together, the anti-democratic forces have a majority in the Caversket. A stable governing majority will be almost impossible. ?]

There are some potential coalition arrangements.

@coalition_menu

# VDSPM COALITIONS

-@spd: We achived a <span style="color: #dc0200;">**[+ spd_name +]**</span> majority!
-@left: We achived a <span style="color: #d61818;">Socialist</span> majority of all the left wing patries!
-@prog_fro: We can atempth to form a <span style="color: #d61818;">Progr</span><span style="color: #ddd500;">esive</span> front with the <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span> and other leftists parties.
-@popu: We can try to form the Popular Front bettwen the <span style="color: #48b94a;">GDSU</span>,<span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span> and other leftists parties.
-@prog: We can atempth to form a <span style="color: #d61818;">Progr</span><span style="color: #ddd500;">esive</span> Coalition with the <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span>.
-@zelt: <span style="color: #dc0200;">Zel</span><span style="color: #ddd500;">tb</span><span style="color: #48b94a;">rin</span> coalition could be possible. 
-@zelt_whide: We can try a wide <span style="color: #dc0200;">Zel</span><span style="color: #ddd500;">tb</span><span style="color: #48b94a;">rin</span> coalition. 
-@grand: Maybe the reactionary Grand coalition? 

# LIBERAL COALITIONS

-@lib: The Liberal coalition can be formed. 
-@lib_whide: The liberals can form a wide coalition. 

# RIGHT COALITIONS

-@cent_right: Center right coalition could form. 
-@right: A reactionary Right wing coalition could form.
-@far_right_ldp: The <span style="color: #caa58b;">[+ dvp_name +]</span> backs the Far-Right Coalition...
-@far_right: The Far-Right coalition could form...

-@no_majority: There is no possilbe majority. 

-@coalition: Maybe we can try some other coalition?

# OPPOSITION COALITIONS - RIGHT

@cent_right
view-if: center_right_coalition >= 45 
subtitle: <span style="color: #48b94a;">GDSU</span> + <span style="color: #caa58b;">[+ dvp_name +]</span> + <span style="color: #1b7035;">LTP</span> + <span style="color: #8c1a16;">MTU</span> + others + <span style="color: #3F7BC1;">MNVP</span> [? if ppu_path = -1 : + <span style="color: #4a9fde;">PPU</span>  ?][? if gnvp_formed = 1 : + <span style="color: #774ae2;">GNVP</span> ?] ([+ center_right_coalition +]%)
choose-if: center_right_coalition >= 50 and liberal_unity >= 30 and liberal_right >= 40
unavailable-subtitle: [? if liberal_unity <= 30: Liberals are too conflicted to form a coherent goverment ?][? if liberal_right <= 40: Liberals and the Right are too conflicted to form a coherent goverment ?]
go-to: right_succed if (dnvp_path - gdsu_ideology + liberal_right/10 - ldp_ideology - 2) >= 0; right_fail if (dnvp_path - gdsu_ideology + liberal_right/10 - ldp_ideology - 2) < 0

@right_succed

-@schmit_right
-@neuman_right
-@wesrap

