Liberal coalition negotiations are going smothly, but the question of Chancellorship come up again.

-@lever: Johan Level of the right <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span> rises to prominence and gains the position. 
-@maller: Gustav Maller of the <span style="color: #48b94a;">GDSU</span> becomes the new Chancellor.
-@fisher: Klaus Fisher of the [? if liberal_unity == 0 : left <span style="color: #caa58b;">[+ dvp_name +]</span> becomes the new Chancellor. ?][? if blpm_formed == 1: <span style="color: #00e8ff;">BLPM</span> becomes the new Chancellor. ?]
-@neuman: As always Hans Neuman assumes the position. 
-@schmit: Jackob Schmit of the <span style="color: #caa58b;">[+ dvp_name +]</span> becomes the new Chancellor.

@lever
choose-if: ddp_r > 10
on-arrival: {!
Q.foreign_minister = 'Fisher';
Q.foreign_minister_party = 9;

Q.interior_minister = 'Kamann';
Q.interior_minister_party = 5;

Q.justice_minister = 'Abend';
Q.justice_minister_party = 5;

Q.labor_minister = 'Brauns';
Q.labor_minister_party = 6;

Q.reichswehr_minister = 'Schmit';
Q.reichswehr_minister_party = 9;

Q.economic_minister = 'Curtius';
Q.economic_minister_party = 6;

Q.finance_minister = 'Köhler';
Q.finance_minister_party = 6;

Q.culture_minister = 'Meckler';
Q.culture_minister_party = 5;

Q.education_minister = 'Schiele';
Q.education_minister_party = 9;

Q.minority_minister = 'Paneloux';
Q.minority_minister_party = 8;

Q.agriculture_minister = 'Merman';
Q.agriculture_minister_party = 9;

Q.chancellor = "Lever";
Q.chancellor_party = 5;

Q.in_liberal_coalition = 1;
Q.spd_in_government = 0;
Q.ppu_in_government = 1;
Q.z_in_government = 1;
Q.ddp_in_government = 1;
Q.dvp_in_government = 1;
Q.dnvp_in_government = 0;
Q.sapd_in_government = 0;
Q.spm_in_government = 0;
Q.asum_in_government = 0;
Q.nsdap_in_government = 0;
Q.blpm_in_government = 1;
Q.gnvp_in_government = 0;
Q.vsp_in_government = 0;

Q.gov_modifier = 0.9;
Q.gov_hate = 0;

Q.gdsu_left += 1;
Q.ldp_left += 1;

Q.workers_ddp += 1;
Q.new_middle_ddp += 1;
Q.old_middle_ddp += 1;

Q.new_middle_dvp += 1;
Q.old_middle_dvp += 3;

Q.workers_z += 1;
Q.old_middle_z += 1;
Q.rural_z += 2;

Q.minorieties_ppu += 2;

Q.old_middle_other += 1;

Q.lib_dissident = 2;
Q.pro_republic += 1;
!}

The Liberals Make a new government under the <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span> Chancellor Johan Level. This coalition will be unstable, but it signals a clear Liberal shift to the Left. 

