@liberal_failed
on-arrival: liberal_unity -= 2; coalition_fail = 1;

The negotiations stall and the Liberals are too confliced to make a coherent goverment. 

-@coalition_menu: Return to the coalition drawing board...


@ministries

We can pick from any number of ministries. Controlling a ministry allows us to directly effect policy in that area. [? if in_left_front : Any ministry that we do not take will be given to the KPD. ?] [? if in_left_front and reichswehr_minister_party == "KPD" : If the KPD controls the Reichswehr Ministry, the army will most likely revolt. ?]

- #mins_1928
- #drop_mins_1928

@labor
title: Labor Ministry
subtitle: They controll the labour policy and disputes on the Federal Level. 
unavailable-subtitle: We do not have enough leverage.
tags: mins_1928
choose-if: leverage >= 10
view-if: labor_minister_party != 3
on-arrival: leverage -= 10; labor_minister_party = 3; labor_minister = "Wissell"
go-to: ministries

Rudolf Wissell of the SPD has been appointed labor minister.

@interior
title: Interior Ministry
subtitle: The Interior Ministry controls domestic security. 
unavailable-subtitle: We do not have enough leverage.
tags: mins_1928
choose-if: leverage >= 10
view-if: interior_minister_party != 3
on-arrival: leverage -= 10; interior_minister_party = 3; interior_minister = "Severing"
go-to: ministries

Carl Severing of the SPD has been appointed Interior Minister.

